-- `vendor.modprobe`: staged module loading depends on complete
-  kernel/modules/DTBO/KMI and filesystem ownership. Do not start with
-  empty module or mismatched kernel trees.
+- `vendor.modprobe`: approved as an own definition,
+  `rootdir/etc/init.vendor_dlkm.rc`. The kernel release ships
+  vendor_dlkm with the stock load list and blocklist; the service runs
+  the platform `/vendor/bin/modprobe -b --all=...modules.load` in AOSP's
